Freemol/Makefile
Freemol/includes/Makefile
Freemol/utils/Makefile
Freemol/moduledata/Makefile
Freemol/modules/Makefile
Freemol/programs/Makefile
Freemol/programs/CSMG/Makefile
Freemol/programs/Freemol/Makefile
Freemol/programs/adfrom/Makefile
Freemol/programs/fit1Dpol/Makefile

Freemol/FFILES/
Freemol/MODFILES/

*.o
*.mod
*.a
*.exe

fundoc.txt
